<article class="finding" style="border-left-color: #b45309">
  <h3><span class="check-id">CHAP-SUP-002</span> No integrity verification for skill dependencies</h3>
  <p class="message">Skill &#39;command-relay&#39; declares dependencies but has no lockfile, so installs aren&#39;t hash-verified or reproducible.</p>
